Hello. I would like a simple screen for our pet adoption shelter to show our adoption applications. Please show the records as separate little boxes stacked one after another, not as a table, with one box per application. Each box should show the "Applicant Name", the "Animal of Interest", and the "Application Date". Please include these four entries:
For "Applicant Name" "Daniel Kim" with "Animal of Interest" "Sunny" and "Application Date" "2024-04-28",
for "Applicant Name" "Brian Foster" with "Animal of Interest" "Peanut" and "Application Date" "2024-05-07",
for "Applicant Name" "Jessica Lee" with "Animal of Interest" "Oliver" and "Application Date" "2024-04-15",
and for "Applicant Name" "James Wilson" with "Animal of Interest" "Rocky" and "Application Date" "2024-05-01".

A simple list of daily construction site logs. Please make it as a simple list, not a table, with one record per line where the "Log Title" is shown first and larger, and the "Weather Condition" and "Site Status" details are shown smaller underneath. It should include these entries:
For "Log Title" "Crane Assembly Day 1" with "Weather Condition" "Windy" and "Site Status" "Delayed",
for "Log Title" "Drywall Hanging Block A" with "Weather Condition" "Cloudy" and "Site Status" "On Schedule",
for "Log Title" "HVAC Ductwork Level 3" with "Weather Condition" "Clear" and "Site Status" "On Schedule",
and for "Log Title" "Scaffolding Erection East Facade" with "Weather Condition" "Clear" and "Site Status" "On Schedule". Thank you.
